# Read-only upstream backend checkouts (vendor/vllm, vendor/llama.cpp) — paths relative to
# llama-proxy/, NOT the dead ../vendor/. Policy + full search recipe: context/plans/RULES.md (P3).
# Skipped by rg unless you pass the flags below, and unseen by the OUTER repo's git — but each
# checkout keeps its OWN .git, so an edit is revertible there (git -C vendor/<tree> checkout -- .),
# never via the outer repo. Never edit, never commit. `git clean -fdx` deletes this tree — use -e vendor.
